      <title>Bitcoin (BTC) Roars Past $70,000 as Yields Sink, Trump Cour</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-20/bitcoin-btc-roars-past-70-000-as-yields-sink-trump-cour</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">1f77b0a8a7e6534279dcc260</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 08:35:07 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Bitcoin surpassed $70,000 for the first time in over two months, propelled by US Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent’s successful move to push US bond yields lower and a high-stakes meeting President Donald Trump held with crypto industry leaders.</description>
