      <title>OKX Bars Claude Use in Hong Kong After Brief Suspension</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-19/crypto-firm-okx-bars-claude-use-in-hong-kong-after-suspension</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">22378c9156f472481d608b3f</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 18:38:32 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Crypto exchange OKX has barred staff based in Hong Kong or traveling through China from using Anthropic PBC’s Claude artificial-intelligence model after having its corporate account briefly suspended, the latest example of how friction between the US and China over AI supremacy is playing out in the corporate world.</description>
